{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Overview</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a <strong>preview of the beginning of <i>Stalked At Home</i></strong>, letting players experience the first part of the story. In this short, self-contained section, you'll explore your home, perform normal daily routines, and begin to sense that something isn\u2019t quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It ends at a specific moment and <strong>does not include the full game</strong>.<br>This demo is intended to give players a <strong>small taste of the gameplay, tone, and psychological tension</strong> that will be expanded upon in the full version.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Gameplay</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully explorable house environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform daily activities (cooking, driving, interacting with objects)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gradual build-up of psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic object interaction</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive and tense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix of normal life and sudden fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on storytelling and environmental details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat \u2014 the horror comes from the feeling of being watched</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712260?t=1748756733","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712260?t=1748756733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712260/7b0dedf8a86b862e39d528c565f89615b39ae1fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748756733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712260/7b0dedf8a86b862e39d528c565f89615b39ae1fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748756733","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes jumpscares, stressful and scary moments."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Overview</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a <strong>preview of the beginning of <i>Stalked At Home</i></strong>, letting players experience the first part of the story. In this short, self-contained section, you'll explore your home, perform normal daily routines, and begin to sense that something isn\u2019t quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It ends at a specific moment and <strong>does not include the full game</strong>.<br>This demo is intended to give players a <strong>small taste of the gameplay, tone, and psychological tension</strong> that will be expanded upon in the full version.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Gameplay</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully explorable house environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform daily activities (cooking, driving, interacting with objects)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gradual build-up of psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic object interaction</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive and tense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix of normal life and sudden fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on storytelling and environmental details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat \u2014 the horror comes from the feeling of being watched</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["Matan.N"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3711650","name":"Stalked At Home"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"descriptio